cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Agri-SDSS"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
version: 2.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/jeremie-durand/Agri-SDSS"
abstract: >-
  Geospatial data platform for sustainable agriculture research in Quebec.
  Automated pipeline from raw geodata to OGC-compliant APIs, a STAC catalog,
  and an AI assistant, currently specialized for Soil Organic Matter (SOM)
  potential mapping and decision support for Quebec agricultural parcels.
keywords:
  - geospatial
  - spatial decision support system
  - sustainable agriculture
  - soil organic matter
  - STAC
  - OGC API
  - Quebec
